# OptimizedDE.db is generated at container startup (see main.py's
# ensure_optimized_db()) - it should never be baked into the image from
# whatever happens to be sitting in a local dev copy of mountpoint/, or a
# stale/incomplete one gets shipped and the app skips rebuilding it
# (this actually happened once: a stray 0-byte file locally became a
# tableless "optimized" db in the image, and the app crashed on boot).
mountpoint/OptimizedDE.db
.git
__pycache__
